{"id": "EUVD-2026-21937", "enisaUuid": "cb3fb766-bac3-30b7-ad28-bbdc6f27ed98", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnetfilter: nfnetlink_log: account for netlink header size\n\nThis is a followup to an old bug fix: NLMSG_DONE needs to account\nfor the netlink header size, not just the attribute size.\n\nThis can result in a WARN splat + drop of the netlink message,\nbut other than this there are no ill effects.", "datePublished": "2026-04-13T13:21:03", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T01:15:53", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4ec216410fac9de83c99177a160ebb8d42fad075", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/09883bf257f4243ed5a1fd35078ec6f0d0f3696a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/761b45c661af48da6a065868d59ab1e1f64fd9b6", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/607245c4dbb86d9a10dd8388da0fb82170a99b61", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6b419700e459fbf707ca1543b7c1b57a60fedb73", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/88a8f56e6276f616baad4274c6b8e4683e26e520", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f08ffa3e1c8e36b6131f69c5eb23700c28cbd262", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6d52a4a0520a6696bdde51caa11f2d6821cd0c01"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-31416"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "051d01bf-1ea8-3d23-bd49-85985fce78f0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.19.12"}, {"id": "14cf8517-3336-3d06-a66f-8678661914ed", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "9dfa1dfe4d5e5e66a991321ab08afe69759d797a <761b45c661af48da6a065868d59ab1e1f64fd9b6"}, {"id": "239f9f47-a7f6-3b01-8e2e-34b1feaaabad", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "3.14.25 <3.15"}, {"id": "254a4270-8b3d-3281-b288-c318b5c26e8d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.0"}, {"id": "3562393a-2be2-3407-b433-ca57fefe0f4d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"n